<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex4Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex4Xd.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 2C_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i-1}}_{t}[\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}+L_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i-1}}_{t}\left[\left\|\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}\right\|^{4}\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 2C_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i-1}}_{t}[\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}+L_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i-1}}_{t}\left[\left\|\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}\right\|^{4}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">which completes the proof.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ 4 Error Propagation Analysis ‣ On the Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with Perturbed Forward-Backward Passes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> bounds the second moment of the bias introduced by forward perturbations. Specifically, the squared deviation of the conditional expected gradient is controlled by two terms: the squared norm of the expected forward error <math id="S4.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i-1}}_{t}[\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-y_{i-1}^{(t)}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i-1}}_{t}[\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-y_{i-1}^{(t)}]</annotation></semantics></math> and the fourth moment of the forward error <math id="S4.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-y_{i-1}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)}-y_{i-1}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math>. Building on this result, we derive an upper bound for the second moment of the overall bias as follows.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem 2</span></span><span id="Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmtheorem2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption3" title="Assumption 3 (Operator smoothness). ‣ 3.3 Assumptions ‣ 3 Preliminaries ‣ On the Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with Perturbed Forward-Backward Passes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> holds. Then for <math id="Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,2,\ldots,N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,2,\ldots,N-1</annotation></semantics></math>, there exist constants <math id="Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{b}_{\delta_{i}},\tilde{C}^{b}_{\delta_{i}},C^{b}_{\varepsilon_{i+1}}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{b}_{\delta_{i}},\tilde{C}^{b}_{\delta_{i}},C^{b}_{\varepsilon_{i+1}}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, which are defined in (<a href="#S4.E33" title="In Proof. ‣ Theorem 2. ‣ 4 Error Propagation Analysis ‣ On the Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with Perturbed Forward-Backward Passes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">33</span></a>), such that</span></p>
<table id="S4.E23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="S4.E23X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E23X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mphantom></mphantom><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E23X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\tilde{\boldsymbol{u}}^{(t)}-\boldsymbol{u}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒖</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>𝒖</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\tilde{\boldsymbol{u}}^{(t)}-\boldsymbol{u}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.E23Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E23Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E23Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}C_{\delta_{i}}^{b}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i}}_{t}[\delta_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]+\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}\tilde{C}_{\delta_{i}}^{b}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\delta_{i}^{(t)}\right\|^{4}\right]+\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}C^{b}_{\varepsilon_{i+1}}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i+1}}[\varepsilon_{i+1}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}C_{\delta_{i}}^{b}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{i}}_{t}[\delta_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]+\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}\tilde{C}_{\delta_{i}}^{b}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\delta_{i}^{(t)}\right\|^{4}\right]+\sum_{i=1}^{N-1}C^{b}_{\varepsilon_{i+1}}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i+1}}[\varepsilon_{i+1}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem2.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">holds for all <math id="Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1,2,\ldots,T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1,2,\ldots,T</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="Thmtheorem2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmtheorem2.p2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p2.9.1" class="ltx_text">We first consider the gradient evaluation at the last component. By (<a href="#S4.E22" title="In Lemma 2. ‣ 4 Error Propagation Analysis ‣ On the Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with Perturbed Forward-Backward Passes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>), we have</span></p>
<table id="S4.E24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="S4.E24X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E24X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\tilde{u}_{N}^{(t)}-{u}_{N}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\nabla_{2}f_{N}(\tilde{y}_{N-1}^{(t)},w_{N}^{(t)})-\nabla_{2}f_{N}(y_{N-1}^{(t)},w_{N}^{(t)})]\right\|^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\tilde{u}_{N}^{(t)}-{u}_{N}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\nabla_{2}f_{N}(\tilde{y}_{N-1}^{(t)},w_{N}^{(t)})-\nabla_{2}f_{N}(y_{N-1}^{(t)},w_{N}^{(t)})]\right\|^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.E24Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E24Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E24Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 4C_{v}^{2}C_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{N-1}}_{t}[\tilde{y}_{N-1}^{(t)}-y_{N-1}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]+2C_{v}^{2}L_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\tilde{y}_{N-1}^{(t)}-y_{N-1}^{(t)}\right\|^{4}\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 4C_{v}^{2}C_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}^{\mathcal{G}_{N-1}}_{t}[\tilde{y}_{N-1}^{(t)}-y_{N-1}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]+2C_{v}^{2}L_{\nabla^{2}f}^{2}\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\tilde{y}_{N-1}^{(t)}-y_{N-1}^{(t)}\right\|^{4}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem2.p2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p2.10.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="Thmtheorem2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,2,\ldots,N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,2,\ldots,N-1</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S4.E25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="S4.E25X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E25X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\tilde{u}_{i}^{(t)}-{u}_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}\left[\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}-\nabla_{2}f_{i}(y_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}v_{i}^{(t)}\right]\right\|^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}[\tilde{u}_{i}^{(t)}-{u}_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]=\mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}\left[\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}-\nabla_{2}f_{i}(y_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}v_{i}^{(t)}\right]\right\|^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.E25Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
