<p id="Thmtheorem2.p2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p2.11.1" class="ltx_text">Using the boundedness of <math id="Thmtheorem2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{i}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{i}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math> and the fact that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}\left[\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}\left(\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}-v_{i}^{(t)}\right)\right]\right\|^{2}\hskip-4.2679pt=\hskip-2.84526pt\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}\left[\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i}}[\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}-v_{i}^{(t)}]\right]\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}\left[\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}\left(\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}-v_{i}^{(t)}\right)\right]\right\|^{2}\hskip-4.2679pt=\hskip-2.84526pt\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}\left[\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})^{\top}\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i}}[\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}-v_{i}^{(t)}]\right]\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{t}\hskip-2.84526pt\left[\left\|\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})\hskip-1.42262pt^{\top}\hskip-1.42262pt\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i}}[\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}\hskip-1.42262pt-\hskip-1.42262ptv_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]\hskip-4.2679pt=\hskip-2.84526pt\mathbb{E}_{t}\hskip-1.42262pt\left[\hskip-1.42262pt\left\|\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})\right\|^{2}\hskip-1.42262pt\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i}}[\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}\hskip-1.42262pt-\hskip-1.42262ptv_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\hskip-1.42262pt\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{t}\hskip-2.84526pt\left[\left\|\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})\hskip-1.42262pt^{\top}\hskip-1.42262pt\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i}}[\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}\hskip-1.42262pt-\hskip-1.42262ptv_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\right]\hskip-4.2679pt=\hskip-2.84526pt\mathbb{E}_{t}\hskip-1.42262pt\left[\hskip-1.42262pt\left\|\nabla_{2}f_{i}(\tilde{y}_{i-1}^{(t)},w_{i}^{(t)})\right\|^{2}\hskip-1.42262pt\left\|\mathbb{E}_{t}^{\mathcal{H}_{i}}[\tilde{v}_{i}^{(t)}\hskip-1.42262pt-\hskip-1.42262ptv_{i}^{(t)}]\right\|^{2}\hskip-1.42262pt\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem2.p2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p2.12.1" class="ltx_text">(which follows from <math id="Thmtheorem2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}^{(t)}\subset\mathcal{H}_{i}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⊂</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}^{(t)}\subset\mathcal{H}_{i}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math>), we obtain</span></p>
