</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem2.p2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem2.p2.18.1" class="ltx_text">We now consider the first term on the right-hand side of (<a href="#S4.E31" title="In Proof. ‣ Theorem 2. ‣ 4 Error Propagation Analysis ‣ On the Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with Perturbed Forward-Backward Passes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">31</span></a>). Using (<a href="#S4.E29" title="In Proof. ‣ Theorem 2. ‣ 4 Error Propagation Analysis ‣ On the Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with Perturbed Forward-Backward Passes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">29</span></a>), we obtain</span></p>
