<p id="Thmtheorem3.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem3.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality follows from Young’s inequality. Taking the conditional expectation with respect to <math id="Thmtheorem3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math> yields</span></p>
